    "name": "Imagine Island",
    "steam_appid": 3055380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/969fd13de18cd989be93e4275bb185ac.avif?t=1744989132\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing the Early Access for Imagine Island! Stay tuned, because more fun is just around the corner. See you soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Imagine Island</strong></i> is a safe and <strong>FREE</strong> virtual world made especially for kids!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the island to uncover mini games, hidden secrets, mysterious objects, and\u2026 rubber duckies? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/3209384bdbcbb6975ff98b501e481e5f.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/3209384bdbcbb6975ff98b501e481e5f.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/3209384bdbcbb6975ff98b501e481e5f.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Mini Games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play all kinds of fun mini games with friends (or new friends) discovered throughout the world! From obstacle courses, to tag and prop hunts, to haunted house coin races (watch out for ghosts!), there is something for everyone and more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/e59be049552431253f53098a2e0d2239.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/e59be049552431253f53098a2e0d2239.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/e59be049552431253f53098a2e0d2239.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Avatar!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress to impress! Customize your avatar to express your true self, or any version of yourself you want to be today! Whether you're a sporty kid, a fashionista, or wearing a full-body shark costume with a pair of shades, everyone can express themselves and show off their creativity in Imagine Island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/d11192a97509b427f230c743b4fcb834.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/d11192a97509b427f230c743b4fcb834.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/d11192a97509b427f230c743b4fcb834.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Party!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is always a new and exciting party on the horizon, with new themed world art, quests, items, and more! You don't want to miss out on the limited-time fun and this chapter of the island\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/4d0505e49f0b92c75ecc95014d415078.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/4d0505e49f0b92c75ecc95014d415078.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/4d0505e49f0b92c75ecc95014d415078.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make New Friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Island is a safe and welcoming community for all young gamers. Bring your friends or meet new friends in this fun-filled world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/5f26f3df1c13a26986ad0daf31433503.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/5f26f3df1c13a26986ad0daf31433503.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/5f26f3df1c13a26986ad0daf31433503.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roleplay Jobs and Activities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roleplay as a barista in the coffee shop or a customer ordering a delicious drink! More fun jobs and roles will be added as the world grows and evolves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/1e9a990fd074d5b6fe6f326994d4ce19.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/1e9a990fd074d5b6fe6f326994d4ce19.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/1e9a990fd074d5b6fe6f326994d4ce19.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Virtual Coins and Items!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn virtual coins by doing all the things you love in the game: exploring, discovering, playing mini games, roleplaying, building, and more! Use your coins to buy awesome virtual items in the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/969fd13de18cd989be93e4275bb185ac.avif?t=1744989132\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for playing the Early Access for Imagine Island! Stay tuned, because more fun is just around the corner. See you soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Imagine Island</strong></i> is a safe and <strong>FREE</strong> virtual world made especially for kids!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the island to uncover mini games, hidden secrets, mysterious objects, and\u2026 rubber duckies? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/3209384bdbcbb6975ff98b501e481e5f.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/3209384bdbcbb6975ff98b501e481e5f.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/3209384bdbcbb6975ff98b501e481e5f.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Mini Games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play all kinds of fun mini games with friends (or new friends) discovered throughout the world! From obstacle courses, to tag and prop hunts, to haunted house coin races (watch out for ghosts!), there is something for everyone and more to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/e59be049552431253f53098a2e0d2239.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/e59be049552431253f53098a2e0d2239.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/e59be049552431253f53098a2e0d2239.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your Avatar!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress to impress! Customize your avatar to express your true self, or any version of yourself you want to be today! Whether you're a sporty kid, a fashionista, or wearing a full-body shark costume with a pair of shades, everyone can express themselves and show off their creativity in Imagine Island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/d11192a97509b427f230c743b4fcb834.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/d11192a97509b427f230c743b4fcb834.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/d11192a97509b427f230c743b4fcb834.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Party!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is always a new and exciting party on the horizon, with new themed world art, quests, items, and more! You don't want to miss out on the limited-time fun and this chapter of the island\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/4d0505e49f0b92c75ecc95014d415078.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/4d0505e49f0b92c75ecc95014d415078.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/4d0505e49f0b92c75ecc95014d415078.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make New Friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine Island is a safe and welcoming community for all young gamers. Bring your friends or meet new friends in this fun-filled world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/5f26f3df1c13a26986ad0daf31433503.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/5f26f3df1c13a26986ad0daf31433503.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/5f26f3df1c13a26986ad0daf31433503.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roleplay Jobs and Activities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roleplay as a barista in the coffee shop or a customer ordering a delicious drink! More fun jobs and roles will be added as the world grows and evolves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/1e9a990fd074d5b6fe6f326994d4ce19.poster.avif?t=1744989132\" width=800 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/1e9a990fd074d5b6fe6f326994d4ce19.webm?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055380/extras/1e9a990fd074d5b6fe6f326994d4ce19.mp4?t=1744989132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Virtual Coins and Items!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn virtual coins by doing all the things you love in the game: exploring, discovering, playing mini games, roleplaying, building, and more! Use your coins to buy awesome virtual items in the game.</p>",
